{"result":"{
  "id": "18485",
  "key": "SFCC-250",
  "summary": "Cart – Maximum Purchase Quantity Enforcement per SKU",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, I want to be clearly informed when I have reached the maximum purchase quantity for a product in my bag, so that I understand why I cannot add more and can still proceed to checkout.\n\nThis story covers the **behaviour and interaction between multiple cart components** when the maximum purchase quantity is reached — it is not a component build story. The following components must be developed before this story can be implemented end to end:\n\n  - **Cart Item component* — renders the quantity stepper and inline warning message \n  - **Page-level banner* — renders the banner at the top of the cart drawer\n\n*Cart Designs:* [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann*Designs?node-id=7383-167327&t=DHEB8HQOXjUUIvMn-0](https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann*Designs) \n\n![\"image-20260825-052315.png\"](image-20260825-052315.png)",
